rganizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":9363456,"digest":"sha256:bdf0f0ae6e0335ab2a2ec11b744107b8edfb471ac0a53b810b90e2f22de20809","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-01T16:33:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T16:33:41Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/releases/download/v0.2.2/JPOP.Corpus.Tool_0.2.2_x64_en-US.msi"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/tarball/v0.2.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/zipball/v0.2.2","body":"**导入完没有歌词**——这一版把 0.1.x 丢掉的那一步补回来了，顺便让导入支持单曲。\n\n## 为什么导进来没有歌词\n\n不在导入，在上一步。0.1.x 的歌词是 `scripts/01_fetch_lrc.py` **下回来的**，\n存成 `raw/lyrics_lrc/{id}.lrc` 再入库；新版的导入只认**已经在磁盘上**的 `.lrc`\n（扫描时在音频旁边找），下载这一步整个没有移植过来。\n从音乐 App 的下载目录拷进来的歌——那里只有音频——于是一行歌词都没有。\n\n## 歌词：三条来路\n\n| 来源 | 在哪 |\n|---|---|\n| 音频旁边的同名 `.lrc` | 补齐时自动优先，不联网 |\n| 在线搜（网易云） | 设置 → 曲库维护 → **补齐缺失歌词**；曲库里单首「在线补齐」 |\n| 自己的文件（`.lrc` / `.txt`） | 曲库里「导入歌词文件…」/「换一份歌词…」 |\n\n- **挑不准就不要**：曲名、歌手、时长都要对得上才采纳，**曲名一模一样也不给歌手放宽**——\n  同名曲太多（「再会」Vaundy / 八代亜紀 / KIRINJI 都有），塞错一首的歌词比没有歌词糟得多。\n  挑不出来的那几首留给你自己导一份。\n- 补回来的歌词存进语料库目录的 `raw/lyrics_lrc/{song_id}.lrc`，和导入进来的完全一样；\n  入库走的也是导入那份代码，所以分词、全文检索、作词作曲署名一个不少。\n- 换一份歌词时，你校正过的分词会按原文套回去，不会丢。\n- 歌词文件的编码按 UTF-8 → CP932 → GBK 依次试。以前只按 UTF-8 硬读，\n  日文站点下回来的 Shift-JIS 文件会变成一整份乱码——那比没有歌词更糟，\n  因为「有歌词」了，补齐流程再也不会来看它。\n\n## 单曲导入\n\n导入页多了「选单曲…」：直接挑一首或几首音频文件，不用先把它们挪进一个目录。\n扫描、复核、确认和按目录导入是同一条链。选了文件又选了它所在的目录只算一次；\n顺手选中的 `.lrc`、封面图会单独列出来告诉你「这几个不是音频，没进计划」。\n\n## 实测\n\n在那个 16 首、0 行歌词的新库的**副本**上跑完：补上 16，挑不出来 0，失败 0。\n逐项对账：635 行歌词、3,890 个词、**0 个空白 token**、全文索引行数 = 歌词行数、\n每首歌随便取一行都搜得到、时间轴全部单调、38 条来自 LRC 的作词作曲署名。\n装好的程序里点「补齐歌词」，界面报「补齐完成：补上 16，挑不出来 0」。\n\n## 下载\n\n- `JPOP.Corpus.Tool_0.2.2_x64-setup.exe`：推荐，NSIS 安装程序\n- `JPOP.Corpus.Tool_0.2.2_x64_en-US.msi`：MSI 安装包\n\n0.2.0 的功能介绍见 [v0.2.0 的发布说明](https://github.com/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/releases/tag/v0.2.0)。\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/releases/400862663","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/releases/400862663/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/releases/400862663/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/releases/tag/v0.2.1","id":400862663,"author":{"login":"Yisoragoto","id":234150855,"node_id":"U_kgDODfTbxw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234150855?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto","html_url":"https://github.com/Yisoragoto","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOTcchac4X5K3H","tag_name":"v0.2.1","target_commitish":"main","name":"v0.2.1：修新装的程序双击打不开","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-01T10:31:24Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T10:32:09Z","published_at":"2026-10-01T10:32:09Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/releases/assets/603006015","id":6030060