Yisoragoto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":9297920,"digest":"sha256:614267b0b1fde772c99f0887aa7e88edeaa3ea274963c3cb678a6d3102802c28","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-01T10:32:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T10:32:09Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/releases/download/v0.2.1/JPOP.Corpus.Tool_0.2.1_x64_en-US.msi"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/tarball/v0.2.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/zipball/v0.2.1","body":"**修 0.2.0 的致命问题：装好之后双击桌面图标毫无反应。**\n\n0.2.0 装过的话，请先卸载或者直接装这一版覆盖；安装目录里那个 4 KB 的 `corpus.db` 是上一版留下的空壳，可以删掉（新版会忽略它）。\n\n## 为什么打不开\n\n一条链：\n\n1. 找语料库时只看 `corpus.db` 这个文件在不在；\n2. 安装目录下没有，于是退到当前工作目录，而 SQLite 打开一个不存在的路径时会**凭空生成一个 0 表的空文件**；\n3. 检查表结构发现没有 `songs` 表，程序打印一行 stderr 就退出——GUI 程序没有控制台，用户看到的就是「点了没反应」；\n4. 那个空文件还留在安装目录里，**之后每次启动都会认准它**，每次都这样退出。\n\n## 这一版的改动\n\n- 判断一个目录是不是语料库时，**真的去查有没有 `songs` 表**，空壳文件不算；\n- 找不到现成的库就用 `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\JPOP Corpus Tool`，并在那里**建一个空库**——新装的程序双击就能开，第一次进去是空库，从「导入」开始加歌；数据目录不放在安装目录下，卸载不会把你的歌和语料一起删掉；\n- **已经有库的人**（0.1.x 用过来的）去「设置 → 关于 → 语料库 → 切换目录…」选那个目录，重启就接上了，不用再配环境变量；\n- 启动真出别的致命错误时会弹一个系统对话框说清楚，不再默不作声地退出。\n\n## 实测\n\n把 exe 单独放进一个空目录、不设 `JPOP_CORPUS_HOME`：程序正常打开，数据目录里建出 22 张表，曲库 / 检索 / 分析 / 导入 / 词典各页都能开；在设置里选 `D:\\jp_corpus` 再重启，读到的就是原来 209 首那个库，分词器也跟着可用了。\n\n## 下载\n\n- `JPOP.Corpus.Tool_0.2.1_x64-setup.exe`：推荐，NSIS 安装程序\n- `JPOP.Corpus.Tool_0.2.1_x64_en-US.msi`：MSI 安装包\n\n0.2.0 的功能介绍见 [v0.2.0 的发布说明](https://github.com/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/releases/tag/v0.2.0)。\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/releases/400807155","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/releases/400807155/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/releases/400807155/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/releases/tag/v0.2.0","id":400807155,"author":{"login":"Yisoragoto","id":234150855,"node_id":"U_kgDODfTbxw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234150855?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto","html_url":"https://github.com/Yisoragoto","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yisoragoto/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOTcchac4X49Tz","tag_name":"v0.2.0","target_commitish":"main","name":"v0.2.0：桌面端重写为 Tauri 2 + React + Rust","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-01T09:14:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T09:16:02Z","published_at":"2026-10-01T09:16:02Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yisoragoto/jpop-corpus-tool/releases/assets/602869942","id":602869942,"node_id":"RA_kwDOTcchac4j7xC2","name":"JPOP.Corpus.Tool_0.